# --- R session cruft -------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
scf-snapshots.Rproj

# --- Data ------------------------------------------------------------
# SCF .rds files live outside the repo: Google Drive/Documents/Data/scf
*.rds

# --- Generated output ------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.html
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md

# knitr leaves a .tex behind when keep_tex: true -- ignore those, but the
# template itself is SOURCE and must be tracked.
*.tex
!snapshots.tex

# --- Tracked on purpose ----------------------------------------------
# The snapshot layout is standalone: it needs the HFL faces and the CSL
# alongside snapshots.tex, so they belong in the repo. The fonts are
# SIL OFL (Bricolage Grotesque, Archivo, Spline Sans Mono) and the OFL
# text must travel with them.
!fonts/
!fonts/*.ttf
!fonts/OFL-*.txt
!default.csl
!snapshots.bib
!render-snapshot.R

# Reference sheet + its source, kept so the design has a known-good baseline
!snapshot-hfl-sample.md
